<title>USA: Just for Feet Q2 sales jump.</title>
<headline>Just for Feet Q2 sales jump.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Just for Feet Inc said Monday that second quarter consolidated net sales rose 92.5 percent from a year earlier, to $112.4 million from $58.4 million.</p>
<p>For the six months ended July 31, consolidated net sales were $205.2 million, up 90.8 percent from $107.5 million in the first six months of the prior year.</p>
<p>Superstore net sales rose 64.4 percent in the quarter. Same-store sales at the superstores rose four percent.</p>
</text>
